# What Graphify must NOT read in this project. .gitignore style (according to Graphify's README, which also
# respects the project's .gitignore). Review it before generating the first graph.
# Why it matters: in the documents pass, Graphify sends the content to the assistant's model.
# Whatever is not ignored here may end up being sent.

# Raw material or material with personal data (conversations, exports, screenshots, data)
knowledge/05 Sources/
sources/
data/
*.csv
*.xlsx

# The agent's memory and local notes (the vault is already its own graph of links)
# Remove these lines only if you want to map the notes.
knowledge/
.memory/
AGENTS.md
docs/STATE.md
docs/DECISIONS.md

# Dependencies, build output and generated files
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
*.min.js
graphify-out/

# Credentials
.env
*.env
client_secret*.json
token.json